  "description": "<h1 data-end=\"120\" data-start=\"79\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"><strong data-end=\"118\" data-start=\"81\">Low Key Ballers Affiliate Program</strong></span></h1>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"149\" data-start=\"122\"><strong data-end=\"147\" data-start=\"125\">Brand Introduction</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-end=\"529\" data-start=\"150\">Low Key Ballers is more than just a basketball apparel brand&mdash;we&rsquo;re a movement. Built for hoopers who let their game speak for itself, our gear is designed to keep you fresh on and off the court. Whether you're hitting step-backs at the park, grinding in the gym, or just chilling with friends, Low Key Ballers represents the mindset of staying humble while dominating the game.</p>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"559\" data-start=\"531\"><strong data-end=\"557\" data-start=\"534\">Product Description</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-end=\"959\" data-start=\"560\">Our collection features high-quality, performance-driven basketball apparel that blends comfort, style, and durability. From moisture-wicking tees and hoodies to premium shorts and accessories, every piece is made for true ballers who take their craft seriously. We focus on minimalist yet bold designs that let your skills shine without the extra flash&mdash;just clean, modern, and stylish hoops gear.</p>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"991\" data-start=\"961\"><strong data-end=\"989\" data-start=\"964\">Unique Selling Points</strong></h2>\r\n<ul data-end=\"1477\" data-start=\"992\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1118\" data-start=\"992\"><strong data-end=\"1024\" data-start=\"994\">Designed for Real Ballers:</strong> Our apparel is built for those who put in work on the court and want to look good doing it.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1236\" data-start=\"1119\"><strong data-end=\"1159\" data-start=\"1121\">Premium Quality, Affordable Price:</strong> We deliver high-performance, comfortable gear without the crazy price tag.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1348\" data-start=\"1237\"><strong data-end=\"1278\" data-start=\"1239\">Exclusive Drops &amp; Limited Releases:</strong> We keep things fresh with unique designs and limited-edition drops.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1477\" data-start=\"1349\"><strong data-end=\"1378\" data-start=\"1351\">Strong Hoops Community:</strong> By repping Low Key Ballers, you&rsquo;re part of a growing basketball culture that respects the grind.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h2 data-end=\"1513\" data-start=\"1479\"><strong data-end=\"1511\" data-start=\"1482\">Affiliate Program Details</strong></h2>\r\n<p data-end=\"1755\" data-start=\"1514\">We&rsquo;re looking for passionate hoopers, social media influencers, and content creators to help spread the word about Low Key Ballers. If you live and breathe basketball, this is your chance to get rewarded for sharing a brand you believe in.</p>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"1780\" data-start=\"1757\"><strong data-end=\"1778\" data-start=\"1761\">How It Works:</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"2032\" data-start=\"1781\">\r\n<li data-end=\"1862\" data-start=\"1781\">Earn a <strong data-end=\"1804\" data-start=\"1790\">commission</strong> for every sale made through your unique affiliate link.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"1931\" data-start=\"1863\">Get access to <strong data-end=\"1902\" data-start=\"1879\">exclusive discounts</strong> for you and your audience.</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"2032\" data-start=\"1932\">Stay updated on <strong data-end=\"1974\" data-start=\"1950\">new product launches</strong> and receive marketing assets to help promote the brand.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3 data-end=\"2058\" data-start=\"2034\"><strong data-end=\"2056\" data-start=\"2038\">Payment Terms:</strong></h3>\r\n<p data-end=\"2167\" data-start=\"2059\">Affiliates will be paid on the <strong data-end=\"2112\" data-start=\"2090\">1st of every month</strong>, ensuring a consistent and reliable payout schedule.</p>\r\n<p data-end=\"2311\" data-start=\"2169\">Join the <strong data-end=\"2215\" data-start=\"2178\">Low Key Ballers Affiliate Program</strong> today and start 